# Legacy domain → CatchJar. Must stay ABOVE the SPA catch-all below:
# _redirects is first-match-wins, and /* would otherwise match everything first.
# The 301! force flag is required so the rule also applies to paths where a real
# file exists (widget.js, avatar-widget.js, assets).
https://supportbots.dev/*  https://catchjar.com/:splat  301!

# SPA fallback — every app route is served by index.html.
/*  /index.html  200
